            0.115,
            0.083,
            0.743,
            0.122
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Have you ever seen wires made of coal or sulfur? Obviously not! We can say that coal and sulfur are not ductile."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.147,
            0.618,
            0.219
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Do you know that ropes made of steel [a mixture of metal (iron) and non-metal (carbon)] wires can support heavy loads? Therefore, they are used in suspension bridges and in cranes to lift heavy objects."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.557,
            0.301,
            0.58
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4.1.3 Sonority"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.586,
            0.744,
            0.661
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Have you ever noticed the sound produced when a metal spoon, or a metal plate, or a metal coin is dropped on the floor? How is it different from the sound produced when a piece of coal or wood is dropped on the floor?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.677,
            0.439,
            0.696
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Activity 4.2: Let us investigate",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.075,
            0.713,
            0.115,
            0.743
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.075,
                0.713,
                0.115,
                0.743
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_4_image_7.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.09,
            0.713,
            0.489,
            0.749
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Caution",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "— Be careful while dropping the objects."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.751,
            0.486,
            0.807
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Take a few objects, such as a metal spoon, a coin, a piece of coal, and a block of wood."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.505,
            0.668,
            0.715,
            0.74
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "I use the difference in sound when my stick hits wood or metal to help find my way."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.811,
            0.593,
            0.832
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Drop them one by one from a certain height."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.836,
            0.633,
            0.875
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Do you notice any difference in the sound produced by these objects?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
